### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### List connections
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections

### Create SQLite connection
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "my-sqlite",
  "dialect": "sqlite",
  "options": {
    "path": "demo.db"
  }
}

### Create MySQL connection (example)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "my-mysql",
  "dialect": "mysql",
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 3306,
  "database": "mydb",
  "username": "root",
  "password": "secret"
}

### Create PostgreSQL connection (example)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "my-pg",
  "dialect": "postgresql",
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 5432,
  "database": "mydb",
  "username": "postgres",
  "password": "secret"
}

### Create SQL Server connection (example)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "my-mssql",
  "dialect": "sqlserver",
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 1433,
  "database": "mydb",
  "username": "sa",
  "password": "secret",
  "options": {
    "driver": "ODBC Driver 18 for SQL Server"
  }
}

### Test connection (replace {id})
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/test

### Get full schema
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/schema

### Get single table schema
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/schema/tasks
